flowIterations.description:
Number of Euler integration steps used to follow the flow field. Higher
values let pixels of large cells reach their sink at the cost of runtime;
Cellpose's default is `200`.

markObjectsOf.description:
Optional: the objects of this class that colocalize also get the
class below (e.g. the ch1 spots overlapping a ch2 spot). `Unset`:
the colocalizing objects of every class.

oneOf.description:
Only the partner with the largest overlap, per class - e.g. a small
object on the border of two larger ones picks the larger overlap;
ties go to the one further up (then further left).

classMapping.description:
Maps the model's classes to this project's segmentation classes;
objects of classes not listed are dropped. Leave empty to write model
class `i` as segmentation class `i + 1`, for every class.
